  "translation": "Olgeta dispela i stap long han bilong papa bilong ol long singsing long haus bilong Yahwe, wantaim ol mitsiltayim, ol nebel na ol kinor, bilong wok bilong haus bilong Elohim; na ol i stap long han bilong king — olsem Asaf, Yedutun na Heman.",
